                <p>* Ambassadors are included in parentheses</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">(Kennedy Library, Crockett Papers, MS 74–287, WJC Book)</p>
                <p> FSRs were members of the Foreign Service Reserve, temporary specialists given
                    grades and pay identical to those of Foreign Service Officers but without
                    tenure.</p>
